# PUBLIC HuBERT model — 377 MB fp32. NO LONGER bundled: it downloads over Wi-Fi at runtime
# (HubertModelManager) and only OUR proprietary codebooks ship in the APK. Kept out of git.
# This is the file to UPLOAD to the model host (GitHub Release asset ≤2 GB) that BuildConfig.HUBERT_MODEL_URL
# points at. Regenerate with FFTT04D/desktop/native/hubert/export_hubert_onnx.py.
hubert_dist/hubert_base.onnx
app/src/main/assets/hubert_base.onnx
